  "result": "Perfect! \u2705 All 226 tests pass (21 new voucher tests + 205 existing). The voucher system is complete:\n\n**`src/invoices.js` \u2014 New function:**\n- `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` \u2014 Applies a fixed-amount voucher to a draft invoice, reduces final total by voucher amount\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals`:**\n- Now returns `voucher` field (amount from invoice.voucher, or 0)\n- Calculation: `total = Math.max(0, subtotal - discount + vat - voucher)`\n- Voucher reduces total after all other calculations (discount and VAT)\n\n**Error handling:**\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 Can only apply vouchers to draft invoices\n- `VOUCHER_EXISTS` \u2014 Cannot apply multiple vouchers to same invoice\n- `AMOUNT_INVALID` \u2014 Voucher amount must be a positive integer (in cents)\n\n**Test coverage (21 new tests):**\n- Basic voucher application\n- Error cases: non-draft invoice, multiple vouchers, negative/zero/non-integer amounts\n- Calculation correctness: total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n- Edge cases: large vouchers, empty code strings, vouchers with discounts\n- Immutability (no mutations)\n- Preservation of other invoice properties\n- Total clamping at zero when voucher exceeds amount owed\n\nThe voucher system correctly applies discounts after VAT (fixing the final amount), distinct from line discounts (which affect VAT calculation).",
